     "Hi Andrew,<div><br></div><div>Perhaps try updating your installation of R and Rattle - what versions do you have?</div><div><br></div><div>Install the latest R from <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478922925000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0-94YGChSZKtBqlzSRlvZ6\">cran.r-project.org</a>. The latest rattle can be installed from:</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div>&gt; install.packages(&quot;rattle&quot;, repos=&quot;<a href=\"http://rattle.togaware.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rattle.togaware.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478922925000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0kRIFizQe8CRGhtf1SxRmV\">http://rattle.togaware.com</a>&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>Hope that helps.</div><div><br></div><div>The messages below indicate a problem with your installation of the XML package.</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br clear=\"all\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\">Graham Williams<br><div><a href=\"http://togaware.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://togaware.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792478922925000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0oR6l1owwn5XXgggO0Sd6b\">http://togaware.com</a></div></div></div>\r\n<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
